    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103690" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεφρ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ash-coloured</i>, <i><span class="en">
